# Routing + Guards

## 1. URL convention

- **Tiếng Anh không dấu** cho path segment.
- Kebab-case cho multi-word: `/flash-sale/abc-123`, `/order-detail/456`.
- KHÔNG dấu, KHÔNG tiếng Việt trong URL: `/don-hang/123` → `/orders/123`.
- Locale KHÔNG xuất hiện trong URL (xem `i18n.mdc` — `localePrefix: 'never'`).

```
✅ /login
✅ /register
✅ /products
✅ /products/abc-123
✅ /cart
✅ /checkout
✅ /orders
✅ /orders/abc-123
✅ /flash-sales
✅ /flash-sales/slot-1
✅ /seller/dashboard
✅ /seller/products
✅ /admin/dashboard

❌ /đăng-nhập
❌ /vi/login
❌ /en/login
❌ /order_detail
```

## 2. Route groups

```
src/app/
├── layout.tsx              # root layout
├── page.tsx                # homepage (/)
├── (buyer)/                # group: buyer-facing, share layout
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   ├── page.tsx
│   ├── products/
│   ├── cart/
│   ├── checkout/
│   └── orders/
├── (auth)/                 # group: auth pages, no header
│   ├── layout.tsx          # center, no header
│   ├── login/page.tsx
│   └── register/page.tsx
├── (seller)/               # group: /seller/**
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   ├── seller/
│   │   ├── dashboard/page.tsx
│   │   ├── products/
│   │   └── flash-sales/
├── (admin)/                # group: /admin/**
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   └── admin/
│       ├── dashboard/page.tsx
│       └── stores/
└── api/                    # ❌ KHÔNG tạo
```

- Route group `(name)` không ảnh hưởng URL — chỉ tổ chức layout.
- Auth pages: group `(auth)` có layout riêng (center card, không header/footer).

## 3. Server Component guard (`src/lib/auth-guard.ts`)

```ts
// src/lib/auth-guard.ts
import { cookies } from 'next/headers';
import { redirect } from 'next/navigation';

export async function requireAuth() {
  const cookieStore = await cookies();
  const token = cookieStore.get('access_token')?.value;
  if (!token) redirect('/login');
  // verify token (qua API hoặc decode JWT)
  const user = await verifyToken(token);
  if (!user) redirect('/login');
  return { user };
}

export async function requireRole(role: 'SELLER' | 'ADMIN') {
  const { user } = await requireAuth();
  if (user.role !== role) redirect('/');
  return { user };
}
```

```tsx
// app/(seller)/seller/dashboard/page.tsx
import { requireRole } from '@/lib/auth-guard';

export default async function SellerDashboard() {
  const { user } = await requireRole('SELLER');
  return <Dashboard user={user} />;
}
```

## 4. middleware.ts (khi migrate)

```ts
// src/middleware.ts
import { NextResponse, type NextRequest } from 'next/server';
import createIntlMiddleware from 'next-intl/middleware';
import { routing } from './i18n/routing';

const intlMiddleware = createIntlMiddleware(routing);

const SELLER_PREFIX = '/seller';
const ADMIN_PREFIX = '/admin';
const AUTH_PREFIX = '/(auth)';

export function middleware(request: NextRequest) {
  const { pathname } = request.nextUrl;
  const token = request.cookies.get('access_token')?.value;

  // Seller/Admin pages — chỉ check sự tồn tại cookie, full verify ở Server Component
  if (pathname.startsWith(SELLER_PREFIX) || pathname.startsWith(ADMIN_PREFIX)) {
    if (!token) {
      return NextResponse.redirect(new URL('/login', request.url));
    }
  }

  // Auth pages (login/register) — nếu đã login thì redirect
  if (pathname === '/login' || pathname === '/register') {
    if (token) {
      return NextResponse.redirect(new URL('/', request.url));
    }
  }

  return intlMiddleware(request);
}

export const config = {
  matcher: ['/((?!api|_next|.*\\..*).*)'],
};
```

- Middleware **chỉ check sự tồn tại cookie**, KHÔNG verify JWT signature (edge runtime giới hạn).
- Verify đầy đủ ở Server Component qua `auth-guard.ts`.

## 5. Redirect after login

```ts
// Sau khi login thành công
const redirectTo = new URL(searchParams.get('callbackUrl') || '/', request.url);
NextResponse.redirect(redirectTo);
```

- Lưu URL ban đầu vào `?callbackUrl=` khi middleware redirect.
- Login page đọc `callbackUrl` để redirect sau khi auth thành công.

## 6. Error pages

- `app/not-found.tsx` — 404.
- `app/error.tsx` — 500 (Client Component).
- `app/global-error.tsx` — fatal error ở root layout.

```tsx
// app/not-found.tsx
export default function NotFound() {
  return (
    <div>
      <h1>404</h1>
      <p>{t('common.notFound')}</p>
      <Link href="/">{t('common.backToHome')}</Link>
    </div>
  );
}
```

## 7. Loading + Suspense

```tsx
// app/(buyer)/products/page.tsx
import { Suspense } from 'react';
import { ProductListSkeleton } from './loading';

export default function ProductsPage() {
  return (
    <Suspense fallback={<ProductListSkeleton />}>
      <ProductList />
    </Suspense>
  );
}
```

- Dùng `<Suspense>` cho Server Component async.
- Loading state qua `loading.tsx` ở cùng folder (Next 16 streaming).

## 8. Metadata

```tsx
// app/(buyer)/page.tsx
import type { Metadata } from 'next';
import { getTranslations } from 'next-intl/server';

export async function generateMetadata(): Promise<Metadata> {
  const t = await getTranslations('home');
  return {
    title: t('title'),
    description: t('description'),
  };
}
```

## 9. Dynamic params (Next 16 async)

```tsx
// app/(buyer)/products/[id]/page.tsx
export default async function ProductPage({
  params,
  searchParams,
}: {
  params: Promise<{ id: string }>;
  searchParams: Promise<{ q?: string }>;
}) {
  const { id } = await params;
  const { q } = await searchParams;
  return <ProductDetail id={id} query={q} />;
}
```

- `params` và `searchParams` là **Promise** (async) trong Next 16 — KHÔNG sync.
- Xem docs trong `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.

## 10. KHÔNG

- KHÔNG dùng Pages Router (`pages/`).
- KHÔNG tạo `app/api/**` (xem `no-overengineering.mdc`).
- KHÔNG hard-code redirect URL — lấy từ `callbackUrl` hoặc default `/`.
- KHÔNG verify JWT signature trong middleware.
- KHÔNG bỏ qua `await params` (Next 16 async).